      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Superbly presented 3 bed peaceful riverside residence with private parking and shared slipway. Featuring a unique stylised interior this turn key property enjoys private patio with stunning Ilen River views. Discreetly located just off Skibbereen town centre.\r\nServices: Mains services, modern electric heating, fibre broadband available"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 5.5m x 1.1m \r\nTiled floor, staircase, washroom\r\n\r\nLounge - 4.5m x 6.5m \r\nWooden floor, feature glass wall with door to south facing patio, steps to dining area\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room - 5.5m x 3.5m \r\nWooden floor in dining area, feature glass wall with door to river side patio, tiled floor in kitchen area, bespoke wooden kitchen with granite worktop, electric oven, induction hob, extractor, integrated dishwasher, fridge, washing machine and dryer, pantry, raised ceiling, storage\r\n\r\nLanding - 24.0m x 18.0m \r\nHotpress\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.2m x 2.8m \r\nWooden floor, built in wardrobe, vaulted panel ceiling, cathedral style window with views to green area\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.8m x 2.8m \r\nWooden floor, built in wardrobe, vaulted panel ceiling, cathedral style window with river views\r\n\r\nBedroom 3/ Study - 3.2m x 2.6m \r\nWooden floor\r\n\r\nShower Room - 2.4m x 1.6m \r\nTiled, shower unit, wash hand basin, w.c.\r\n\r\n"
      },
